		margin-bottom: 8px;
		letter-spacing: 2px;
	}

	.poster-title {
		font-size: 24px;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: #000000;
	}

	.activity-info {
		width: 100%;
		margin-bottom: 32px;
		padding: 24px;
		background-color: #F9F9F9;
		border-radius: 12px;
	}

	.activity-name {
		font-size: 20px;
